@host = http://localhost:5000

### SETUP A: admin login (send first)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin#12345" }

### SETUP B: register a normal user (201 first time, 409 on reruns, both are fine)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "normaluser", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### SETUP C: login as the normal user
# @name userLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "normaluser", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### ROW 1. Expect 401: POST /books with no token
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "No Token", "author": "Nobody", "isbn": "978-1000000001", "price": 10 }

### ROW 2a. Setup for the 403 and 204 rows: create a temp book as admin. Expect 201
# @name tempBook
POST {{host}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Temp Book", "author": "Temp Author", "isbn": "978-3333333333", "price": 12.5 }

### ROW 2b. Expect 403: DELETE as a normal user
DELETE {{host}}/books/{{tempBook.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ROW 3. Expect 400: price = 0
POST {{host}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Free Book", "author": "Someone", "isbn": "978-1000000003", "price": 0 }

### ROW 4. Expect 400: missing title
POST {{host}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "Someone", "isbn": "978-1000000004", "price": 10 }

### ROW 5. Expect 409: duplicate ISBN (reuses the Clean Code book from earlier)
POST {{host}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Clean Code Copy", "author": "Someone", "isbn": "978-0132350884", "price": 20 }

### ROW 6. Expect 404: book that doesn't exist
GET {{host}}/books/999999

### ROW 7. Expect 204: DELETE the temp book as admin
DELETE {{host}}/books/{{tempBook.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ROW 8. Expect 401: login with a wrong password
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "definitely-wrong" }

### BONUS 1. Expect 400: wrong data type for price
POST {{host}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bad Type", "author": "Someone", "isbn": "978-1000000009", "price": "abc" }

### BONUS 2. Expect 400: invalid paging
GET {{host}}/books?page=0&pageSize=500

### BONUS 3. Expect 200: paging, search and sorting work
GET {{host}}/books?page=1&pageSize=5&search=clean&sortBy=price&desc=true

### BONUS 4. Expect 404: DELETE the same book again (it's gone now)
DELETE {{host}}/books/{{tempBook.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}